{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, fully responsive Shopify Liquid section for Kiss & Kry titled "Giving Back – Outgrown, Not Outworn."
    
    IMPORTANT: Use the uploaded reference image as the exact visual design reference. Reproduce the layout, proportions, spacing, typography, colours, card styles, image placements and overall composition as closely as possible.
    
    Do not redesign, simplify or reinterpret the layout.
    
    The section should communicate Kiss & Kry's sustainable babywear return and redistribution initiative.
    
    1. OVERALL DESIGN & COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Create a full-width premium editorial-style section.
    
    Main background:
    
    Deep muted olive green: #5E6848 (approximate).
    
    Primary text: Warm ivory #F6F2E5.
    
    Secondary text: Muted sage-beige #C7C7AD.
    
    Accent colour: Warm mustard gold #E9AC29.
    
    Light card background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Dark olive card: #495239.
    
    Borders: Subtle translucent sage/olive.
    
    Design characteristics:
    
    Luxury editorial aesthetic.
    
    Premium babywear branding.
    
    Minimal, sophisticated and spacious.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle background decorative circular outlines.
    
    No unnecessary gradients.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    Avoid generic ecommerce layouts.
    
    Use Montserrat for all typography.
    
    2. SECTION ONE – HERO / GIVING BACK INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a two-column desktop layout.
    
    LEFT COLUMN – 48% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "GIVING BACK"
    
    Add a short horizontal mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Outgrown,
    Not Outworn."
    
    Typography:
    
    Large, bold Montserrat.
    
    Approximately 40–44px desktop.
    
    Warm ivory colour.
    
    Tight line height.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Description:
    
    "At Kiss & Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our 'Giving Back' initiative."
    
    Use 14px text with comfortable line spacing.
    
    Below the description, create an editorial image composition:
    
    Large vertical image on the left showing a premium cardboard return box with Kiss & Kry branding.
    
    Smaller rectangular image on the right showing a baby garment being held or folded.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Subtle overlapping composition.
    
    Add small ivory pill labels:
    "Step 01 · Return"
    "Step 02 · Redistribute"
    
    Add a circular olive-and-gold seal overlapping the images, featuring a return/recycle arrow and small curved text:
    "RETURN • REWARD • REDISTRIBUTE"
    
    RIGHT COLUMN – 52% WIDTH
    
    Small eyebrow heading:
    "OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE"
    
    Add a thin horizontal line extending towards the right.
    
    Create two vertically stacked process cards.
    
    STEP 01 – RETURN & REWARD
    
    Card styling:
    
    Background: #F5F0E9.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Generous internal padding.
    
    Light, premium appearance.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular olive icon background.
    
    Minimal package/return box icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 01"
    
    Heading: "Return & Reward", Description:
    
    "When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!"
    
    Reward information inside a highlighted horizontal pill/card:
    
    Golden circular badge containing "15%"
    
    Text: "Off your next Kiss & Kry purchase"
    
    Supporting text: "as a token of our appreciation."
    
    Use warm beige/gold background and subtle gold border.
    
    STEP 02 – REDISTRIBUTE & REJOICE
    
    Card styling:
    
    Dark olive background: #495239.
    
    Rounded corners: 22px.
    
    Ivory text.
    
    Top section:
    
    Circular icon.
    
    Minimal home icon.
    
    Small label: "STEP 02"
    
    Heading: "Redistribute & Rejoice"
    
    Description:
    
    "We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community."
    
    Below the description, create three small outlined pill indicators with check icons:
    
    Inspected
    
    Cleaned
    
    Given to families in need
    
    Connect both cards visually using a small circular golden arrow positioned between them.
    
    3. SECTION TWO – THE IMPACT
    
    Maintain the same deep olive background.
    
    Create a two-column introduction row.
    
    LEFT SIDE
    
    Eyebrow label:
    "THE IMPACT"
    
    Include a short golden horizontal line.
    
    Heading:
    
    "Making a Difference
    Together."
    
    Use bold ivory typography, approximately 30px.
    
    RIGHT SIDE
    
    Description:
    
    "By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste."
    
    Use muted sage-beige text, 14px with comfortable line height.
    
    THREE IMPACT CARDS
    
    Below the introduction, create three equal-width columns.
    
    Each column should have:
    
    Thin subtle top border.
    
    Circular outline icon holder.
    
    Small mustard-gold icon.
    
    Ivory heading.
    
    Muted beige description., CARD 01
    
    Icon: Leaf
    
    Heading:
    "Sustainability"
    
    Description:
    "By recycling our garments, we reduce waste and promote a more sustainable fashion industry. Every returned item is one less piece of clothing that could end up in a landfill."
    
    CARD 02
    
    Icon: Users / Community
    
    Heading:
    "Community Support"
    
    Description:
    "By passing returned clothes on to those in need, we strengthen our community and support families who may not have the means to buy new clothes."
    
    CARD 03
    
    Icon: Heart
    
    Heading:
    "Customer Connection"
    
    Description:
    "This initiative lets us build a deeper bond with our customers — a sense of shared purpose and mutual benefit that goes well beyond the checkout."
    
    Spacing:
    
    Three equal columns.
    
    Approximately 40px gap.
    
    Generous vertical spacing.
    
    Consistent alignment.
    
    4. SECTION THREE – FINAL CTA / JOIN US
    
    Create a large, premium rounded rectangular panel below the impact cards.
    
    This panel must have a warm ivory background (#F5F0E0).
    
    Layout:
    
    Two columns.
    
    Left: 55%.
    
    Right: 45%.
    
    Internal padding: 48–50px.
    
    Border radius: 28px.
    
    Image must have rounded corners.
    
    LEFT CONTENT
    
    Eyebrow label:
    "JOIN US"
    
    Add a short mustard-gold line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Join Us in Making
    a Difference."
    
    Use large olive-green bold typography, approximately 32px.
    
    Description:
    
    "When you choose Kiss & Kry, you're not just dressing your baby in the finest clothing — you're contributing to a cycle of generosity and care. Together, we can create a brighter, more sustainable future for all our children."
    
    Below, create a highlighted testimonial-style message with a thin vertical golden line on the left.
    
    Text:
    
    "Thank you for being a valued member of the Kiss & Kry family. Together, we can make a difference, one adorable outfit at a time."
    
    Small signature:
    "♥ WITH LOVE, TEAM KISS & KRY", CTA BUTTONS
    
    Create two horizontally aligned actions:
    
    Primary button:
    "Start a return →"
    
    Olive-green background.
    
    Ivory text.
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Secondary text link:
    "See how it works"
    
    Olive-green text.
    
    Underline.
    
    No background.
    
    Both buttons must be configurable through Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    RIGHT IMAGE
    
    Use a premium lifestyle photograph of a happy baby sitting in a warm neutral nursery environment, wearing a cream Kiss & Kry baby outfit with the brand logo.
    
    Image requirements:
    
    Natural warm lighting.
    
    Premium editorial photography.
    
    Cream, beige and olive surroundings.
    
    Rounded corners (approximately 22px).
    
    Maintain the baby's full upper body and outfit visibility.
    
    Use an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    5. TYPOGRAPHY & VISUAL HIERARCHY
    
    Use Montserrat throughout.
    
    Main hero heading: 40–44px, weight 700.
    
    Section heading: 30–32px, weight 700.
    
    Card headings: 19–21px, weight 600.
    
    Body text: 13–14px, weight 400.
    
    Eyebrow labels: 9–10px, uppercase, letter spacing 2px.
    
    Small labels: 10–11px.
    
    Maintain consistent line height, alignment and spacing.
    
    6. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    
    Preserve the two-column hero structure.
    
    Maintain three impact columns.
    
    Keep the CTA panel in two columns.
    
    Preserve the overlapping image composition.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Reduce column gaps.
    
    Maintain readable card dimensions.
    
    Prevent text and image overlap.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack the hero columns vertically.
    
    Display the process cards one after another.
    
    Stack the three impact cards vertically.
    
    Stack the CTA image below its text.
    
    Make buttons appropriately sized.
    
    Reduce heading sizes proportionally.
    
    Maintain sufficient padding.
    
    Do not allow horizontal overflow.
    
    7. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR CUSTOMIZATION
    
    Make the entire section editable.
    
    Provide settings for:
    
    General
    
    Main background colour.
    
    Primary text colour.
    
    Secondary text colour.
    
    Accent colour.
    
    Font sizes.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Content maximum width.
    
    Hero
    
    Main heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Hero images.
    
    Return box image.
    
    Garment redistribution image.
    
    Circular seal text.
    
    Step 01
    
    Icon.
    
    Heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Reward percentage.
    
    Reward message.
    
    Step 02
    
    Icon.
    
    Heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Three process indicators.
    
    Impact
    
    Section heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Three editable impact blocks.
    
    Individual icons, headings and descriptions.
    
    CTA
    
    Heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Highlighted message.
    
    Signature.
    
    Baby lifestyle image.
    
    Primary and secondary button text and URLs.
    
    All images must use Shopify image_picker settings.
    
    Allow merchants to add, remove and reorder impact blocks where possible.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}{display:block;width:{{block.settings.desktop_width_percent}}%;max-width:100%;margin:auto;padding:{{block.settings.section_padding}}px clamp(20px,5vw,72px);background:{{block.settings.background_color}};color:{{block.settings.text_color}};font-family:var(--font-body-family,'Montserrat',sans-serif);overflow:hidden}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__inner{max-width:{{block.settings.content_max_width}}px;margin:auto}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__hero,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-head,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(28px,6vw,78px);align-items:center}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__hero{align-items:start}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:{{block.settings.secondary_color}};font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 17px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label:before{content:'';width:27px;height:1px;background:{{block.settings.accent_color}}}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,46px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 18px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__body{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:{{block.settings.secondary_color}}}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__mosaic{height:310px;max-width:480px;position:relative;margin-top:26px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic{position:absolute;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:#ddd8cf}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic--return{inset:0 38% 0 0}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic--garment{right:0;top:15%;width:48%;height:68%;border:5px solid {{block.settings.background_color}};box-sizing:border-box}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic img,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__tag{position:absolute;bottom:12px;background:#f6f2e5;color:#37402c;border-radius:30px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:10px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__tag--two{right:1px;bottom:28px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__seal{position:absolute;left:51%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:86px;height:86px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;background:#495239;border:1px solid {{block.settings.accent_color}};color:{{block.settings.accent_color}};font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cards{display:grid;gap:15px;position:relative}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card{border-radius:22px;padding:24px;background:{{block.settings.light_color}};color:#363b2d}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card--dark{background:{{block.settings.dark_color}};color:{{block.settings.text_color}}}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cardtop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon{width:43px;height:43px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#495239;color:#fff;flex:none}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__step{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#686b56}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card--dark .ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__step{color:{{block.settings.secondary_color}}}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card h3{font-size:20px;margin:0}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;color:#45493e}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card--dark p{color:{{block.settings.secondary_color}}}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:15px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #c49a45;border-radius:14px;background:#f0e2c4;color:#363b2d}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__percent{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:{{block.settings.accent_color}};font-weight:700;flex:none}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward strong,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward small{display:block}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward strong{font-size:12px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward small{font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__arrow{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:{{block.settings.accent_color}};color:#303929;width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:14px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pill{font-size:10px;border:1px solid rgba(246,242,229,.55);border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact{margin-top:75px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-head{margin-bottom:34px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.12;margin:0}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-item{border-top:1px solid rgba(199,199,173,.45);padding-top:22px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-icon{width:42px;height:42px;border:1px solid {{block.settings.accent_color}};border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:{{block.settings.accent_color}};margin-bottom:14px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-icon svg{width:20px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-item h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-item p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:{{block.settings.secondary_color}};margin:0}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta{margin-top:68px;background:#F5F0E0;border-radius:28px;padding:48px;color:#495239;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 14px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta .ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label{color:#495239}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-copy{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#555b47}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__quote{border-left:2px solid {{block.settings.accent_color}};padding-left:16px;margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__signature{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:700}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-image{height:340px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:#e0ddd1}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-image img,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-image svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;margin-top:22px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 23px;background:#495239;color:#F6F2E5;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;transition:background-color .2s ease,color .2s ease}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__button:hover{background:#343d29;color:#fff}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__link{color:#495239;font-size:13px;text-underline-offset:4px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__button:focus-visible,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #8b6417;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:750px){.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}{width:100%;padding:{{block.settings.mobile_padding}}px 20px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__hero,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-head,.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__mosaic{height:270px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact{margin-top:55px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta{padding:27px;margin-top:52px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-image{height:270px}.ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__arrow{width:30px;height:30px}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}" {{block.shopify_attributes}}><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__inner"><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__hero"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label">GIVING BACK</p><h1 class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__h1">{{block.settings.hero_heading}}</h1><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__body">{{block.settings.hero_description}}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__mosaic"><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic--return">{% if block.settings.return_image %}<img src="{{block.settings.return_image | image_url: width: 900}}" alt="{{block.settings.return_image.alt | escape}}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{'image' | placeholder_svg_tag}}{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pic--garment">{% if block.settings.garment_image %}<img src="{{block.settings.garment_image | image_url: width: 700}}" alt="{{block.settings.garment_image.alt | escape}}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{'image' | placeholder_svg_tag}}{% endif %}</div><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__tag">Step 01 · Return</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__tag ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__tag--two">Step 02 · Redistribute</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__seal">{{block.settings.seal_text}}</span></div></div><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label">OUR UNIQUE INITIATIVE</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cards"><article class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card"><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon">↩</span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__step">STEP 01</p><h3>{{block.settings.step1_heading}}</h3></div></div><p>{{block.settings.step1_description}}</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__reward"><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__percent">{{block.settings.reward_percent}}%</span><div><strong>{{block.settings.reward_message}}</strong><small>as a token of our appreciation.</small></div></div></article><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><article class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__card--dark"><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cardtop"><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon">⌂</span><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__step">STEP 02</p><h3>{{block.settings.step2_heading}}</h3></div></div><p>{{block.settings.step2_description}}</p><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pills"><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pill">✓ {{block.settings.process_one}}</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pill">✓ {{block.settings.process_two}}</span><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__pill">✓ {{block.settings.process_three}}</span></div></article></div></div></div>
<div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact"><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-head"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label">THE IMPACT</p><h2>{{block.settings.impact_heading}}</h2></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__body">{{block.settings.impact_description}}</div></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-grid">{% for i in (1..3) %}{% assign title_id = 'impact_title_' | append: i %}{% assign desc_id = 'impact_desc_' | append: i %}<article class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-item"><span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__impact-icon">{% case i %}{% when 1 %}♧{% when 2 %}♙{% else %}♡{% endcase %}</span><h3>{{block.settings[title_id]}}</h3><p>{{block.settings[desc_id]}}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div>
<div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta"><div><p class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__label">JOIN US</p><h2>{{block.settings.cta_heading}}</h2><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-copy">{{block.settings.cta_description}}</div><blockquote class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__quote">{{block.settings.cta_message}}<span class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__signature">{{block.settings.signature}}</span></blockquote><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__actions">{% if block.settings.primary_url != blank %}<a class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__button" href="{{block.settings.primary_url}}">{{block.settings.primary_text}} →</a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.secondary_url != blank %}<a class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__link" href="{{block.settings.secondary_url}}">{{block.settings.secondary_text}}</a>{% endif %}</div></div><div class="ai-giving-{{ai_gen_id}}__cta-image">{% if block.settings.cta_image %}<img src="{{block.settings.cta_image | image_url: width: 1000}}" alt="{{block.settings.cta_image.alt | escape}}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{'image' | placeholder_svg_tag}}{% endif %}</div></div></div></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Giving back","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"General"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"content_max_width","label":"Content max width","min":800,"max":1400,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1250},{"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":30,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":70},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_padding","label":"Mobile padding","min":20,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":40},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#5E6848"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Primary text","default":"#F6F2E5"},{"type":"color","id":"secondary_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#C7C7AD"},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent","default":"#E9AC29"},{"type":"color","id":"light_color","label":"Light card","default":"#F5F0E9"},{"type":"color","id":"dark_color","label":"Dark card","default":"#495239"},{"type":"header","content":"Hero"},{"type":"text","id":"hero_heading","label":"Main heading","default":"Outgrown, Not Outworn."},{"type":"richtext","id":"hero_description","label":"Description","default":"<p>At Kiss &amp; Kry, we believe true luxury goes beyond premium fabrics and adorable designs. It's compassion, community and sustainability — and it sits at the heart of our Giving Back initiative.</p>"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"return_image","label":"Return box image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"garment_image","label":"Redistribution image"},{"type":"text","id":"seal_text","label":"Seal text","default":"RETURN · REWARD · REDISTRIBUTE"},{"type":"header","content":"Step 01"},{"type":"text","id":"step1_heading","label":"Heading","default":"Return & Reward"},{"type":"textarea","id":"step1_description","label":"Description","default":"When your little one outgrows our beautiful clothes, don't let them gather dust. Send them back to us!"},{"type":"text","id":"reward_percent","label":"Reward percentage","default":"15"},{"type":"text","id":"reward_message","label":"Reward message","default":"Off your next Kiss & Kry purchase"},{"type":"header","content":"Step 02"},{"type":"text","id":"step2_heading","label":"Heading","default":"Redistribute & Rejoice"},{"type":"textarea","id":"step2_description","label":"Description","default":"We don't just collect used clothes — we make sure they find a new home within our community."},{"type":"text","id":"process_one","label":"Process indicator 1","default":"Inspected"},{"type":"text","id":"process_two","label":"Process indicator 2","default":"Cleaned"},{"type":"text","id":"process_three","label":"Process indicator 3","default":"Given to families in need"},{"type":"header","content":"Impact"},{"type":"text","id":"impact_heading","label":"Section heading","default":"Making a Difference Together."},{"type":"richtext","id":"impact_description","label":"Description","default":"<p>By joining our Giving Back programme, you're directly helping build a more sustainable future — and supporting those less fortunate. Small actions make a big difference, and with your help we can extend the life of our premium baby clothes and reduce waste.</p>"},{"type":"text","id":"impact_title_1","label":"Impact heading 1","default":"Sustainability"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_desc_1","label":"Impact description 1","default":"By recycling our garments, we reduce waste and promote a more sustainable fashion industry. Every returned item is one less piece of clothing that could end up in a landfill."},{"type":"text","id":"impact_title_2","label":"Impact heading 2","default":"Community Support"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_desc_2","label":"Impact description 2","default":"By passing returned clothes on to those in need, we strengthen our community and support families who may not have the means to buy new clothes."},{"type":"text","id":"impact_title_3","label":"Impact heading 3","default":"Customer Connection"},{"type":"textarea","id":"impact_desc_3","label":"Impact description 3","default":"This initiative lets us build a deeper bond with our customers — a sense of shared purpose and mutual benefit that goes well beyond the checkout."},{"type":"header","content":"Call to action"},{"type":"text","id":"cta_heading","label":"Heading","default":"Join Us in Making a Difference."},{"type":"richtext","id":"cta_description","label":"Description","default":"<p>When you choose Kiss &amp; Kry, you're not just dressing your baby in the finest clothing — you're contributing to a cycle of generosity and care. Together, we can create a brighter, more sustainable future for all our children.</p>"},{"type":"textarea","id":"cta_message","label":"Highlighted message","default":"Thank you for being a valued member of the Kiss & Kry family. Together, we can make a difference, one adorable outfit at a time."},{"type":"text","id":"signature","label":"Signature","default":"♥ WITH LOVE, TEAM KISS & KRY"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"cta_image","label":"Baby lifestyle image"},{"type":"text","id":"primary_text","label":"Primary button text","default":"Start a return"},{"type":"url","id":"primary_url","label":"Primary button link"},{"type":"text","id":"secondary_text","label":"Secondary link text","default":"See how it works"},{"type":"url","id":"secondary_url","label":"Secondary link URL"}],"presets":[{"name":"Giving back"}],"tag":null,"class":"giving-back-block"}{% endschema %}